{"name": "10000 Pizzas Please", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Aliens have landed, and they're starving for pizza!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In 10000 Pizzas Please, you'll build a fully automated pizza factory to serve wave after wave of hungry alien customers. Gather ingredients, lay down rails, power your machines, and craft the most efficient production line in the galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"280\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798960/extras/ce55ff8693ce435996371591d59ce781.poster.avif?t=1783609910\" width=\"640\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798960/extras/ce55ff8693ce435996371591d59ce781.webm?t=1783609910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798960/extras/ce55ff8693ce435996371591d59ce781.mp4?t=1783609910\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Plan. Build. Deliver!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use limited resources to create the ultimate pizza pipeline. Every ingredient and machine has a cost; efficiency is the key to success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798960/extras/73a0898e3f920a3a883272b3b5c955d2.poster.avif?t=1783609910\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798960/extras/73a0898e3f920a3a883272b3b5c955d2.webm?t=1783609910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798960/extras/73a0898e3f920a3a883272b3b5c955d2.mp4?t=1783609910\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Manage Your Restaurant</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sell the pizzas you produce in your own restaurant, then improve it to attract more customers. Hurry up, they eat fast!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798960/extras/384c90fa8528c699e30a3ddcc892a0d0.poster.avif?t=1783609910\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798960/extras/384c90fa8528c699e30a3ddcc892a0d0.webm?t=1783609910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798960/extras/384c90fa8528c699e30a3ddcc892a0d0.mp4?t=1783609910\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Automation Meets Cooking</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From raw dough to sizzling perfection, deploy a range of machines: dough pressers, sauce dispensers, cheese, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>11 Tasty Ingredients:</strong> Mix &amp; match for hundreds of combos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>8 Machine Types:</strong> Automate like a true factory master.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Restaurant Management:</strong> Design and expand it to earn more money.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Endless Replayability:</strong> Design, test, optimize, repeat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Clean, Colorful Visuals:</strong> Watch your factory flourish in style.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you satisfy the galaxy's appetite? Wishlist Now!</p> </div>", "short_desc": "Build a pizza factory to feed an endless swarm of hungry aliens! Automate every machine, fine-tune your conveyor belts, and engineer the perfect production line in a gloriously chaotic cooking-and-automation sim where more cheese means more cosmic mayhem.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798960/2d76d8eb68afbe004f561dc3a9b858af79561454/header.jpg?t=1783609910", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Indie", "Simulation", "Automation", "Strategy", "Resource Management", "Casual"], "developers": "Team K6", "publishers": "Team K6", "release_date": "To be announced", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3798960", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "30 April 2026 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/rHLu8Uuf1vg", "first_seen": 1777500000.0, "review_rank": 739}